  "meta": {
    "name": "ironvale",
    "worldSeed": 17760331,
    "prompt": "Ironvale is a cramped industrial valley given over entirely to work. A railway runs the length of the trough with a station, an engine shed, a signal box and an omnibus hub around one hard yard, and rolling stock standing on the sidings. West of the yard a smoky bank of works climbs the shelf — forge, foundry, blast furnace, kilns, mills and a ropewalk — while generating plants, a gasworks and a coal tipple sit east under a moor of wind turbines and solar panels. A reservoir in the southeast feeds a water tower, a cistern, a well house and a pumping station. Underneath everything is a second town: a mine head whose working runs back under the collier's shelf, catacombs off the old toll road, sewers and cistern halls beneath the streets, a subway platform, a bunker and a silo shaft.",
    "spawn": {
      "zone": "center"
    }
  },
